    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Ingest: law cards into the database\n## - Loads the prepared law articles (297 cards: GDPR 118, EU AI Act 179) from a file into the Supabase table `documents`, each with its metadata (law, article number, title) and an embedding.\n\n## - Run by hand once, and again after a law update. Not part of the daily operation, so the workflow is not active.\n\n## - The cards were cut and cleaned before (one card per article or part of an article), so this workflow only reads and stores them. The main workflow later loads them by exact filter on the metadata.",
        "height": 328,
        "width": 2212,
        "color": "#FDF7F7"
      },
