        -160,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read/Write Files from Disk\n### What happens:\n- Reads the file `chunks.json` from the server folder.\n### Why:\n- The cards were prepared outside of n8n and only need to be loaded.\n### Settings:\n- File path under `/home/node/n8n-files/` (the folder mounted into the n8n container).",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 356,
        "color": "#F09999"
      },
      "id": "970b8cb5-6a09-4a61-95f3-94a0c561f964",
